<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NSS Clubs Architecture Flowchart</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0B1120;
    --card-bg: #111827;
    --card-border: #1E293B;
    --text-main: #F8FAFC;
    --text-muted: #94A3B8;
    --accent-blue: #38BDF8;
    --accent-purple: #818CF8;
    --accent-green: #10B981;
    --accent-orange: #F59E0B;
    --accent-pink: #F472B6;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    background-color: var(--bg);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--text-main);
    padding: 40px 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  /* Phase Containers */
  .phase {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .phase-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    padding-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .phase-number {
    background: var(--accent-blue);
    color: var(--bg);
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .phase-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .phase-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  /* Grid Layouts */
  .grid-4 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  /* Nodes (The Boxes) */
  .node {
    background: #0F172A;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .node:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
  }

  .node h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .node p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .node ul {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-left: 16px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* Badges */
  .badge {
    font-size: 9px;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .badge-singleton { background: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.2); color: var(--accent-purple); }
  .badge-ref { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .badge-array { background: rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.2); color: var(--accent-pink); }
  .badge-static { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: var(--accent-orange); }
  .badge-dynamic { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: var(--accent-green); }

  /* Connectors */
  .connector {
    width: 2px;
    height: 30px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
    position: relative;
  }

  .connector::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -6px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border-left: 6px solid transparent;
    border-right: 6px solid transparent;
    border-top: 8px solid var(--accent-purple);
  }

  /* Special Highlight Nodes */
  .highlight-blue { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); }
  .highlight-purple { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-purple); }
  .highlight-green { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-green); }
  .highlight-orange { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-orange); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .phase-desc { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <h1>NSS Clubs Platform Architecture</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Headless CMS Data Flow & Next.js App Router Integration</p>

  <!-- PHASE 1: SANITY STUDIO -->
  <div class="phase">
    <div class="phase-header">
      <div class="phase-number">1</div>
      <div class="phase-title">Sanity Studio (Content Entry)</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">8 Custom Schemas • Relational Data Model</div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-4">
      <div class="node highlight-purple">
        <h3>Homepage <span class="badge badge-singleton">Singleton</span></h3>
        <p>Global page settings. Locked to a single document ID.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>President Message</li>
          <li>Legacy Stats (Objects)</li>
          <li>Featured Events <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
          <li>Gallery Showcase <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="node highlight-blue">
        <h3>Team Member</h3>
        <p>The core directory of all students and faculty.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name, Photo, Bio</li>
          <li>Grade, Gender</li>
          <li>Email, LinkedIn</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="node highlight-blue">
        <h3>Executive Team</h3>
        <p>Maps roles to specific members for a given year.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Academic Year</li>
          <li>President <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
          <li>Secretary, Treasurer <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="node highlight-blue">
        <h3>Club</h3>
        <p>The 6 core institutions (STEM, Sports, etc).</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Slug (Auto-generated)</li>
          <li>Logo, Hero Image</li>
          <li>Heads <span class="badge badge-array">Array</span> <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
          <li>Achievements <span class="badge badge-array">Array</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="node highlight-blue">
        <h3>Event</h3>
        <p>Hackathons, meets, and gatherings.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Datetime Picker</li>
          <li>Registration Link</li>
          <li>Associated Club <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
          <li>Countdown Toggle</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="node highlight-blue">
        <h3>Gallery Item</h3>
        <p>Centralized media library.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Image (Hotspot enabled)</li>
          <li>Linked Club <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
          <li>Linked Event <span class="badge badge-ref">Ref</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="node highlight-orange">
        <h3>Announcements</h3>
        <p>Standard notices and alerts.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Title, Content</li>
          <li>Expiry Date</li>
          <li>Active Toggle</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="node highlight-orange">
        <h3>Popups</h3>
        <p>Time-sensitive marketing modals.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>CTA Text & Link</li>
          <li>Start/End Datetime</li>
          <li>Active Toggle</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="connector"></div>

  <!-- PHASE 2: CONTENT LAKE -->
  <div class="phase">
    <div class="phase-header">
      <div class="phase-number">2</div>
      <div class="phase-title">Sanity Content Lake (The Brain)</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">Real-time API & Image CDN</div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="node highlight-purple">
        <h3>GROQ Query Engine</h3>
        <p>Resolves references and shapes JSON payloads.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><code>*[_id == "homepage"]</code></li>
          <li><code>*[_type == "club" && slug.current == $slug]</code></li>
          <li>Projection & Reference Resolution (<code>-></code>)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="node highlight-purple">
        <h3>Image Pipeline (cdn.sanity.io)</h3>
        <p>On-the-fly image transformation.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Auto WebP/AVIF conversion</li>
          <li>Dynamic cropping & resizing</li>
          <li>Respects Studio Hotspots</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="connector"></div>

  <!-- PHASE 3: NEXT.JS BRIDGE -->
  <div class="phase">
    <div class="phase-header">
      <div class="phase-number">3</div>
      <div class="phase-title">Next.js App Router (The Bridge)</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">Server Components & Type Safety</div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-4">
      <div class="node">
        <h3>Data Fetching</h3>
        <p><code>sanity/lib/queries.ts</code></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Async Server Components</li>
          <li><code>client.fetch()</code></li>
          <li>Pinned API Version (<code>2026-05-31</code>)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="node">
        <h3>Type Safety</h3>
        <p><code>sanity/lib/types.ts</code></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Strict TS Interfaces</li>
          <li>Autocomplete support</li>
          <li>Prevents runtime errors</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="node">
        <h3>Image Builder</h3>
        <p><code>sanity/lib/image.ts</code></p>
        <ul>
          <li><code>urlFor(image)</code></li>
          <li>Chaining dimensions</li>
          <li>Next.js <code>&lt;Image&gt;</code> integration</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="node">
        <h3>Routing</h3>
        <p>Dynamic App Router</p>
        <ul>
          <li><code>/clubs/[slug]</code></li>
          <li><code>params.slug</code> extraction</li>
          <li>404 Fallback handling</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="connector"></div>

  <!-- PHASE 4: FRONTEND UI -->
  <div class="phase">
    <div class="phase-header">
      <div class="phase-number">4</div>
      <div class="phase-title">Frontend UI (The Browser)</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">Hybrid Rendering Strategy</div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="node highlight-orange">
        <h3>Static Content <span class="badge badge-static">Hardcoded</span></h3>
        <p>Baked into the React components at build time. Fast, unchanging branding.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Global Navbar & Footer</li>
          <li>Homepage Hero Banner</li>
          <li>Homepage Clubs Grid (Links to 6 routes)</li>
          <li>CTA Sections & Contact Forms</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="node highlight-green">
        <h3>Dynamic Content <span class="badge badge-dynamic">Fetched</span></h3>
        <p>Pulled from Sanity at request time. Editable by the Executive Team.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>President's Message & Stats</li>
          <li>Live Events & Countdowns</li>
          <li>Individual Club Pages (<code>/clubs/stem</code>)</li>
          <li>Active Popups & Announcements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
